# What `vsce package` must leave out of a .vsix.
#
# The rule is the opposite of .gitignore's: everything is included unless it is
# listed here, so a new file is shipped by default and this list only has to
# name the things that must not be.
#
# `node_modules` is deliberately absent: the extension is not bundled, so
# `vscode-languageclient` has to be in the package for it to load at all.

.vscode/**
.vscode-test/**
.gitignore
.eslintrc*
**/*.map
**/.DS_Store
**/tsconfig.json
